  "content": "<!doctype lake><meta name=\"doc-version\" content=\"1\" /><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"fixed\" /><meta name=\"paragraphSpacing\" content=\"relax\" /><card type=\"block\" name=\"hr\" value=\"data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22QLlxO%22%7D\"></card><h1 data-lake-id=\"25ebf0fc\" id=\"25ebf0fc\"><span data-lake-id=\"u7c4325a1\" id=\"u7c4325a1\">乳腺癌的预测</span></h1><p data-lake-id=\"u5c9a5b31\" id=\"u5c9a5b31\"><br></p><h2 data-lake-id=\"61a3ec66\" id=\"61a3ec66\"><span data-lake-id=\"ub7e159fa\" id=\"ub7e159fa\">介绍</span></h2><p data-lake-id=\"u08eef55c\" id=\"u08eef55c\"><br></p><p data-lake-id=\"udce11060\" id=\"udce11060\"><span data-lake-id=\"u374a56cf\" id=\"u374a56cf\">本节我们以乳腺癌的预测为实例,阐述PyTorch求解一个非线性的问题</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u5740b5f5\" id=\"u5740b5f5\"><br></p><ol list=\"ubbf827b5\"><li fid=\"uaf09e119\" data-lake-id=\"u71f86d6e\" id=\"u71f86d6e\"><span data-lake-id=\"uccfbd671\" id=\"uccfbd671\">数据集的标准化</span></li></ol><ol list=\"ubd5fa833\" start=\"2\"><li fid=\"uc57dbb47\" data-lake-id=\"u4be99a94\" id=\"u4be99a94\"><span data-lake-id=\"uae18792a\" id=\"uae18792a\">数据集的划分</span></li></ol><ol list=\"u6cbacde8\" start=\"3\"><li fid=\"uaa811244\" data-lake-id=\"u27e91acb\" id=\"u27e91acb\"><span data-lake-id=\"u691caa29\" id=\"u691caa29\">Sigmoid函数</span></li></ol><ol list=\"ua33483b0\" start=\"4\"><li fid=\"u6aa67cfe\" data-lake-id=\"udf673cba\" id=\"udf673cba\"><span data-lake-id=\"ufaa36585\" id=\"ufaa36585\">乳腺癌的预测</span></li></ol><h2 data-lake-id=\"a2cd5af3\" id=\"a2cd5af3\"><span data-lake-id=\"ud464e5be\" id=\"ud464e5be\">数据集的预处理</span></h2><p data-lake-id=\"uaeecf90b\" id=\"uaeecf90b\"><br></p><p data-lake-id=\"u9095ddae\" id=\"u9095ddae\"><span data-lake-id=\"udd2c80ed\" id=\"udd2c80ed\">首先,让我们来加载数据集合.这里我们使用pandas对数据集合进行加载</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"ue65c730d\" id=\"ue65c730d\"><br></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22python%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%23%20%E9%A2%84%E6%B5%8B%E4%B9%B3%E8%85%BA%E7%99%8C%2C%E4%BD%BF%E7%94%A8pandas%E5%AF%B9%E6%95%B0%E6%8D%AE%E9%9B%86%E5%90%88%E8%BF%9B%E8%A1%8C%E5%8A%A0%E8%BD%BD%5Cnimport%20pandas%20as%20pd%20%5Cn%5Cndf%20%3D%20pd.read_csv(%5C%22.%2Fbreast_cancer.csv%5C%22)%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Afalse%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22584b412e%22%7D\"></card><p data-lake-id=\"u537fe2e8\" id=\"u537fe2e8\"><br></p><p data-lake-id=\"ua6c94136\" id=\"ua6c94136\"><span data-lake-id=\"u700bb9c4\" id=\"u700bb9c4\">从结果中我们知道该数据集合中共有569条数据,每条数据有30个和乳腺癌相关的病变特征,最后一列是该患者是否患有乳腺癌的诊断结果. 其中0表示没有患有乳腺癌,1表示患有乳腺癌.</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"ub7a17248\" id=\"ub7a17248\"><br></p><p data-lake-id=\"ue0602df8\" id=\"ue0602df8\"><span data-lake-id=\"ue4d8c85b\" id=\"ue4d8c85b\">我们可以利用pandas中的切片,先将上表中的特征和标签分开</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u302e8d8a\" id=\"u302e8d8a\"><br></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22python%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%23%20%E6%AF%8F%E8%A1%8C%E6%95%B0%E6%8D%AE%E6%9C%8930%E4%B8%AA%E4%B9%B3%E8%85%BA%E7%97%85%E7%90%86%E7%89%B9%E5%BE%81%2C%20%E6%9C%80%E5%90%8E%E4%B8%80%E5%88%97%E8%A1%A8%E7%A4%BA%E6%98%AF%E5%90%A6%E6%82%A3%E6%9C%89%E4%B9%B3%E8%85%BA%E7%99%8C%5CnX%20%3D%20df%5Bdf.columns%5B0%3A-1%5D%5D.values%5CnY%20%3D%20df%5Bdf.columns%5B-1%5D%5D.values%5Cnprint(X.shape%2CY.shape)%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Afalse%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22id%22%3A%2292ae6fb1%22%7D\"></card><p data-lake-id=\"u05fe5e08\" id=\"u05fe5e08\"><br></p><p data-lake-id=\"ud385f471\" id=\"ud385f471\"><span data-lake-id=\"uc8865b2d\" id=\"uc8865b2d\">可以看到共有569条数据,每条数据有30个特征和1个标签</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u5eb14373\" id=\"u5eb14373\"><br></p><h3 data-lake-id=\"c56c1ec8\" id=\"c56c1ec8\"><span data-lake-id=\"ua982afbf\" id=\"ua982afbf\">数据集的划分和标准化</span></h3><p data-lake-id=\"u4e457b32\" id=\"u4e457b32\"><br></p><p data-lake-id=\"ub1852035\" id=\"ub1852035\"><span data-lake-id=\"u264312f4\" id=\"u264312f4\">为了能够评估模型的好坏, 我们利用sklearn.model_selection函数,将原数据按比例随机分为训练集数据和测试集数据</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u561c052e\" id=\"u561c052e\"><br></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22python%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22from%20sklearn.model_selection%20import%20train_test_split%5Cn%23%20%E6%8C%89%E7%85%A70.8%20%E5%92%8C%200.2%20%E7%9A%84%E6%AF%94%E4%BE%8B%E9%9A%8F%E6%9C%BA%E5%88%92%E5%88%86%E6%95%B0%E6%8D%AE%E9%9B%86%E5%90%88%5CnX_train%2CX_test%2CY_train%2CY_test%20%3D%20train_test_split(X%2CY%2Ctest_size%3D0.2%2Crandom_state%3D1234)%5Cnprint(X_train.shape%2CY_train.shape%2CX_test.shape%2CY_test.shape)%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Afalse%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22c378e908%22%7D\"></card><p data-lake-id=\"ub6c5eebe\" id=\"ub6c5eebe\"><br></p><p data-lake-id=\"u72a21ce2\" id=\"u72a21ce2\"><span data-lake-id=\"ud6d27a1c\" id=\"ud6d27a1c\">为了加快模型的收敛速度,一般我们都需要对原始数据进行标准化处理,将所有的数据按照比例缩放到一定范围内.这里我们可以使用sklearn.preprocessing来对数据集合进行标准化</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"uf1d55e2e\" id=\"uf1d55e2e\"><br></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22python%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22from%20sklearn.preprocessing%20import%20StandardScaler%5Cnsc%20%3D%20StandardScaler()%5Cn%23%20%E5%AF%B9%E7%89%B9%E5%BE%81%E8%BF%9B%E8%A1%8C%E6%A0%87%E5%87%86%E5%8C%96%5CnX_train%20%3D%20sc.fit_transform(X_train)%5CnX_test%20%3D%20sc.fit_transform(X_test)%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Afalse%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22aea3446a%22%7D\"></card><p data-lake-id=\"u7fa7cb89\" id=\"u7fa7cb89\"><br></p><p data-lake-id=\"u30d54791\" id=\"u30d54791\"><span data-lake-id=\"u84eda0b2\" id=\"u84eda0b2\">最后, 为了将数据放入PyTorch定义的模型之中, 我们必须将所有的数据转为张量类型:</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"udbc1ca28\" id=\"udbc1ca28\"><br></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22python%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22import%20torch%5Cnimport%20numpy%20as%20np%5CnX_train%20%3D%20torch.from_numpy(X_train.astype(np.float32))%5CnY_train%20%3D%20torch.from_numpy(Y_train.astype(np.float32))%5Cn%5CnX_test%20%3D%20torch.from_numpy(X_test.astype(np.float32))%5CnY_test%20%3D%20torch.from_numpy(Y_test.astype(np.float32))%5Cn%5Cn%23%20%E5%B0%86%E6%A0%87%E7%AD%BE%E8%BD%AC%E6%88%902%E7%BB%B4%5CnY_train%20%3D%20Y_train.view(Y_train.shape%5B0%5D%2C1)%5CnY_test%20%3D%20Y_test.view(Y_test.shape%5B0%5D%2C1)%5Cnprint(X_train.size()%2CY_train.size())%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Afalse%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22b65350d3%22%7D\"></card><p data-lake-id=\"ue6dc39c3\" id=\"ue6dc39c3\"><br></p><h2 data-lake-id=\"25ebf0fc-1\" id=\"25ebf0fc-1\"><span data-lake-id=\"ua8219b80\" id=\"ua8219b80\">乳腺癌的预测</span></h2><p data-lake-id=\"uac45d676\" id=\"uac45d676\"><br></p><p data-lake-id=\"u016c1366\" id=\"u016c1366\"><span data-lake-id=\"uc1679518\" id=\"uc1679518\">模型的定义</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u9ca74320\" id=\"u9ca74320\"><br></p><p data-lake-id=\"u262abccd\" id=\"u262abccd\"><span data-lake-id=\"u7717fdf7\" id=\"u7717fdf7\">在处理完数据后,接下来, 我们就需要建立相应的模型,用于乳腺癌的预测了.</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u7957e866\" id=\"u7957e866\"><br></p><p data-lake-id=\"u23213134\" id=\"u23213134\"><span data-lake-id=\"u93ccc113\" id=\"u93ccc113\">线性函数是一条没有上界和下界的直线, 即线性函数预测出来的值可以很大, 也可以非常小. 而实验数据的标签只有0(患病)或1(不患病), 因此用线性函数来拟合乳腺癌的数据点是不合理的.</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u067370ee\" id=\"u067370ee\"><br></p><p data-lake-id=\"u2459aaf7\" id=\"u2459aaf7\"><span data-lake-id=\"u1cd7d211\" id=\"u1cd7d211\">我们需要找到输出始终为0-1之间的函数模型.如果拥有这样的函数模型,那么将任意的x放入该模型中,都会输出0-1之间的值.这个值我们可以看做说患有乳腺癌的概率.如果这个概率值小于0.5则表示没有患乳腺癌.如果这个概率值大于0.5则表示患有乳腺癌.</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u4205d147\" id=\"u4205d147\"><br></p><p data-lake-id=\"u5db36f54\" id=\"u5db36f54\"><span data-lake-id=\"u747ee0b7\" id=\"u747ee0b7\">逻辑回归函数Sigmoid就是这样的一种函数,该函数又叫做激活函数:</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"uf494f685\" id=\"uf494f685\"><br></p><p data-lake-id=\"u14eb2e14\" id=\"u14eb2e14\" style=\"text-align: center\"><card type=\"inline\" name=\"math\" value=\"data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Crho%20%3D%20%5C%5Cfrac%7B1%7D%7B1%2B%20e%5E%7B-z%7D%7D%5Cn%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.yuque.com%2Fapi%2Fservices%2Fgraph%2Fgenerate_redirect%2Flatex%3F%255Crho%2520%253D%2520%255Cfrac%257B1%257D%257B1%252B%2520e%255E%257B-z%257D%257D%250A%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22MaoWT%22%7D\"></card></p><p data-lake-id=\"u1705bcc7\" id=\"u1705bcc7\"><br></p><p data-lake-id=\"u0feb2163\" id=\"u0feb2163\"><span data-lake-id=\"uf5f8c2b2\" id=\"uf5f8c2b2\">该函数的几何图形如下所示:</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u64b51442\" id=\"u64b51442\"><card type=\"inline\" name=\"image\" value=\"data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2023%2Fjpeg%2F27903758%2F1688028578916-b036cf1a-ec08-41b5-9b20-c06cfe23179f.jpeg%22%2C%22taskId%22%3A%22ua58695dc-fd31-41ae-9335-1c87bda1d1d%22%2C%22clientId%22%3A%22ucf461bb3-bf31-4%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22url%22%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22from%22%3A%22paste%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A800%2C%22originHeight%22%3A368%2C%22ratio%22%3A1.100000023841858%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%230c0909%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22u9cf250b2%22%7D\"></card></p><p data-lake-id=\"ufded03af\" id=\"ufded03af\"><card type=\"inline\" name=\"image\" value=\"data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22tu_3.png%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22%22%2C%22ratio%22%3A1%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22id%22%3A%22l5Uj9%22%7D\"></card></p><p data-lake-id=\"u2fc30268\" id=\"u2fc30268\"><br></p><p data-lake-id=\"u9730cf65\" id=\"u9730cf65\"><span data-lake-id=\"u24b6732b\" id=\"u24b6732b\">从图中我们可以看出,该函数就是一个上下界分别为1和0的有界非线性函数.</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u74828cb1\" id=\"u74828cb1\"><br></p><p data-lake-id=\"u49e90d00\" id=\"u49e90d00\"><span data-lake-id=\"u51a741ad\" id=\"u51a741ad\">我们可以将线性函数的输出,经过上面的激活函数处理,得到0-1之间的结果</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"ue9519d20\" id=\"ue9519d20\"><br></p><p data-lake-id=\"u2b401e58\" id=\"u2b401e58\"><span data-lake-id=\"uf29c5060\" id=\"uf29c5060\">综上, 预测乳腺癌的模型如下:</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"ud308c8ab\" id=\"ud308c8ab\"><br></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22python%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22import%20torch.nn%20as%20nn%5Cn%5Cnclass%20Model(nn.Module)%3A%5Cn%20%20%20%20def%20__init__(self%2Cn_input_features)%3A%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20super(Model%2Cself).__init__()%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20self.linear%20%3D%20nn.Linear(n_input_features%2C1)%5Cn%20%20%20%20%5Cn%20%20%20%20def%20forward(self%2Cx)%3A%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20y_pred%20%3D%20torch.sigmoid(self.linear(x))%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20return%20y_pred%5Cn%20%20%20%20%5Cn%23%20%E8%8E%B7%E5%8F%96%E6%A0%B7%E6%9C%AC%E9%87%8F%E5%92%8C%E7%89%B9%E5%BE%81%E6%95%B0%5Cnn_samples%2Cn_features%20%3D%20X.shape%5Cn%23%20%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%E7%9A%84%E5%88%9D%E5%A7%8B%E5%8C%96%5Cnmodel%20%3D%20Model(n_features)%5Cn%23%20%E6%8D%9F%E5%A4%B1%E5%87%BD%E6%95%B0%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%5Cnloss%20%3D%20nn.BCELoss()%5Cn%23%20%E8%BF%AD%E4%BB%A3%E6%AC%A1%E6%95%B0%5Cnnum_epochs%20%3D%20100%5Cn%23%20%E5%AD%A6%E4%B9%A0%E7%8E%87%5Cnlearning_rate%20%3D%200.1%5Cn%23%20%E4%BC%98%E5%8C%96%E5%99%A8%5Cnoptimizer%20%3D%20torch.optim.SGD(model.parameters()%2Clr%3Dlearning_rate)%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Afalse%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22id%22%3A%2245b40d2c%22%7D\"></card><p data-lake-id=\"u29825d36\" id=\"u29825d36\"><br></p><h2 data-lake-id=\"fff01de4\" id=\"fff01de4\"><span data-lake-id=\"u78ac980c\" id=\"u78ac980c\">模型的训练</span></h2><p data-lake-id=\"udc5b1868\" id=\"udc5b1868\"><br></p><p data-lake-id=\"u4b2d6151\" id=\"u4b2d6151\"><span data-lake-id=\"uaae8650d\" id=\"uaae8650d\">定义完损失函数和优化器后,接下来的模型训练步骤就是固定的了,如下:</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u588de8e2\" id=\"u588de8e2\"><br></p><ul list=\"u65b0968d\"><li fid=\"u4e921233\" data-lake-id=\"u61d6c532\" id=\"u61d6c532\"><span data-lake-id=\"udf696976\" id=\"udf696976\">通过模型的正向传播,输出预测结果</span></li></ul><ul list=\"ud3078371\"><li fid=\"u9ff647d3\" data-lake-id=\"uee87fb03\" id=\"uee87fb03\"><span data-lake-id=\"ua40eaf8d\" id=\"ua40eaf8d\">通过预测结果和真实标签计算损失</span></li></ul><ul list=\"uff54c824\"><li fid=\"u67b9dd08\" data-lake-id=\"u0302edc2\" id=\"u0302edc2\"><span data-lake-id=\"u800b0bb1\" id=\"u800b0bb1\">通过反向传播,获取梯度</span></li></ul><ul list=\"u246ecd19\"><li fid=\"u5dffe7ee\" data-lake-id=\"u41b820af\" id=\"u41b820af\"><span data-lake-id=\"u9708ce50\" id=\"u9708ce50\">通过梯度更新模型的权重</span></li></ul><ul list=\"u0794d109\"><li fid=\"u8eeae84d\" data-lake-id=\"u61e6bcf4\" id=\"u61e6bcf4\"><span data-lake-id=\"u997ffd3a\" id=\"u997ffd3a\">进行梯度的清空</span></li></ul><ul list=\"u87e2e645\"><li fid=\"u96dacef6\" data-lake-id=\"u5d453390\" id=\"u5d453390\"><span data-lake-id=\"ud7a76083\" id=\"ud7a76083\">循环上面的操作,直到损失较小为止</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id=\"u0d3c021f\" id=\"u0d3c021f\"><br></p><p data-lake-id=\"u618e1341\" id=\"u618e1341\"><span data-lake-id=\"ud6f81cf9\" id=\"ud6f81cf9\">让我们用代码完成上面的步骤:</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u3bf327ca\" id=\"u3bf327ca\"><br></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22python%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%23%20%E5%9B%BA%E5%AE%9A%E6%AD%A5%E9%AA%A4%3A%201.%E6%AD%A3%E5%90%91%E4%BC%A0%E6%92%AD%2C%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%E9%A2%84%E6%B5%8B%202.%E8%AE%A1%E7%AE%97%E6%8D%9F%E5%A4%B1%203.%E5%AF%B9%E6%8D%9F%E5%A4%B1%E8%AE%A1%E7%AE%97%E6%A2%AF%E5%BA%A6%204.%E6%9B%B4%E6%96%B0%E6%9D%83%E9%87%8D%205.%E6%B8%85%E7%A9%BA%E6%A2%AF%E5%BA%A6%206.%E5%BE%AA%E7%8E%AF%E4%B8%8A%E8%BF%B0%E6%AD%A5%E9%AA%A4%5Cnfor%20epoch%20in%20range(num_epochs)%3A%5Cn%20%20%20%20y_pred%20%3D%20model(X_train)%5Cn%20%20%20%20l%20%3D%20loss(y_pred%2CY_train)%5Cn%20%20%20%20%23%20%E5%8F%8D%E5%90%91%E4%BC%A0%E6%92%AD%5Cn%20%20%20%20l.backward()%5Cn%20%20%20%20%23%20%E6%9B%B4%E6%96%B0%E6%9D%83%E9%87%8D%5Cn%20%20%20%20optimizer.step()%5Cn%20%20%20%20%23%20%E6%B8%85%E7%A9%BA%E6%A2%AF%E5%BA%A6%5Cn%20%20%20%20optimizer.zero_grad()%5Cn%20%20%20%20%5Cn%20%20%20%20if%20epoch%255%20%3D%3D%200%3A%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20print(f%5C%22epoch%3A%7Bepoch%7D%2Closs%3D%7Bl.item()%3A.4f%7D%5C%22)%5Cn%5Cnprint(%5C%22%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%E8%AE%AD%E7%BB%83%E5%AE%8C%E6%88%90%5C%22)%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Afalse%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22a5b1133b%22%7D\"></card><p data-lake-id=\"ua213ddd7\" id=\"ua213ddd7\"><br></p><p data-lake-id=\"uad36cebb\" id=\"uad36cebb\"><span data-lake-id=\"ud2285204\" id=\"ud2285204\">综上,我们训练好了一个乳腺癌的预测模型. 我们可以尝试对任意一条数据进行预测</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u845011e7\" id=\"u845011e7\"><br></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22python%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22index%20%3D%20np.random.randint(0%2Clen(X_test))%5Cny_pred%20%3D%20model(X_test%5Bindex%5D)%5Cn%5Cny_pred_label%20%3D%20y_pred.round()%5Cn%23%20%E5%B0%86%E7%BB%93%E6%9E%9C%E8%BD%AC%E4%B8%BAnumpy%E7%B1%BB%E5%9E%8B%5Cnreal%20%3D%20Y_test%5Bindex%5D.detach().numpy()%5B0%5D%5Cnpre%20%3D%20y_pred_label.detach().numpy()%5B0%5D%5Cn%5Cnprint(f%5C%22%E7%AC%AC%7Bindex%7D%E6%9D%A1%E6%95%B0%E6%8D%AE%E7%9A%84%E7%9C%9F%E5%AE%9E%E7%BB%93%E6%9E%9C%E4%B8%BA%3A%7Breal%7D%2C%E9%A2%84%E6%B5%8B%E7%BB%93%E6%9E%9C%E4%B8%BA%3A%7Bpre%7D%5C%22)%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Afalse%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22id%22%3A%2221f1cd25%22%7D\"></card><p data-lake-id=\"u5a8c6418\" id=\"u5a8c6418\"><br></p><p data-lake-id=\"u2edc1b39\" id=\"u2edc1b39\"><span data-lake-id=\"u8b8680a0\" id=\"u8b8680a0\">由于模型准确率不是100%,因此上面预测结果和真实结果可能会不同. 如果我们多运行几次,必定会出现预测结果和真实结果相同的情况</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u5c6c7861\" id=\"u5c6c7861\"><br></p><p data-lake-id=\"uf450675b\" id=\"uf450675b\"><span data-lake-id=\"ued6c1e2f\" id=\"ued6c1e2f\">下面我们来计算一下模型准确率到底是多少?</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"ue8b716ee\" id=\"ue8b716ee\"><br></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22python%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22with%20torch.no_grad()%3A%5Cn%20%20%20%20y_pred%20%3D%20model(X_test)%5Cn%20%20%20%20%23%20%E4%B8%8A%E9%9D%A2%E8%AE%A1%E7%AE%97%E5%87%BA%E6%9D%A5%E7%9A%84%E7%BB%93%E6%9E%9C%E6%98%AF0-1%E4%B9%8B%E9%97%B4%E7%9A%84%E6%95%B0%2C%20%E6%88%91%E4%BB%AC%E5%B0%86%E6%95%B0%E6%8D%AE%E8%BF%9B%E8%A1%8C%E5%9B%9B%E8%88%8D%E4%BA%94%E5%85%A5%2C%E5%BE%97%E5%88%B0%E4%B8%8E%E5%8E%9F%E8%A1%A8%E7%9B%B8%E5%90%8C%E7%9A%84%E6%83%85%E5%86%B5%5Cn%20%20%20%20y_pred_cls%20%3D%20y_pred.round()%5Cn%20%20%20%20%23%20%E7%BB%9F%E8%AE%A1%E7%BB%93%E6%9E%9C%5Cn%20%20%20%20acc%20%3D%20y_pred_cls.eq(Y_test).sum().numpy()%2Ffloat(Y_test.shape%5B0%5D)%5Cn%20%20%20%20print(f%5C%22%E5%87%86%E7%A1%AE%E7%8E%87%3A%7Bacc.item()%3A.4f%7D%5C%22)%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Afalse%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22d3ea9baf%22%7D\"></card><p data-lake-id=\"u439ebe22\" id=\"u439ebe22\"><br></p><p data-lake-id=\"u403d78a9\" id=\"u403d78a9\"><span data-lake-id=\"u9b5ed96d\" id=\"u9b5ed96d\">我们利用测试数据,计算出了整个模型的预测准确率大概在90%左右,证明我们的模型可以很好的进行乳腺癌的诊断预测</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"uf52370c5\" id=\"uf52370c5\"><br></p><h2 data-lake-id=\"5db9fd7c\" id=\"5db9fd7c\"><span data-lake-id=\"u0b2dba01\" id=\"u0b2dba01\">小结</span></h2><p data-lake-id=\"u962f1369\" id=\"u962f1369\"><br></p><p data-lake-id=\"u951e584c\" id=\"u951e584c\"><span data-lake-id=\"u1d1da197\" id=\"u1d1da197\">本节以乳腺癌的预测为例,引入了激活函数Sigmoid概念.建立了一个简单的非线性模型用于诊断患者是否患有乳腺癌. 其实, 这个案例已经是一个线性函数+激活函数的简单神经网络模型啦!</span></p>",
